# The dashboard never reads an API key from the environment: anything prefixed
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the client bundle and would ship a working key to
# every visitor. Paste your key into the dashboard's connect screen instead; it
# is stored in that browser's localStorage only.

# Uncomment to point the dashboard at a local Worker (`npm run dev` in ../).
# Defaults to https://kairos.govern-ai.ca when unset.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:8789
